GROKIPEDIA_USER_AGENT=VeriVentureBot/1.0 (+https://veriventure.xyz)
WIKIPEDIA_USER_AGENT=VeriVentureBot/1.0 (+https://veriventure.xyz)

# OriginTrail DKG Edge Node configuration
